  {
   "text": "The Marvel Super Heroes Beginner Box is a supplemental Magic set with additional Marvel cards, designed as onboarding experience for beginning players. It was marketed as the best way to learn how to play and included the essentials for someone's first game of Magic: The Gathering . It was released on June 26, 2026.",
   "scene": 0,
   "section": ""
  },
  {
   "text": "The Beginner Box consists of 10 packets with 20 Marvel Super Heroes cards inside each one, with two packets for each of Magic’s five colors of mana (200 cards total). Using the mix-and-match system originally designed for the Jumpstart product line , players can combine and recombine those 10 packets into many different kinds of decks. Beginning players can start with a tutorial game with two pre-shuffled 20-card decks, each with a step-by-step tutorial that will walk them through their first five turns.",
   "scene": 1,
   "section": "Description"
  },
  {
   "text": "Each card in the Captain America Tutorial and Iron Man decks is numbered in the bottom-left corner of the card. The card on the top of each half-deck should be \"Captain America Tutorial 1\" and \"Iron Man Tutorial 1.\"",
   "scene": 1,
   "section": "Description"
  },
  {
   "text": "Note that the packs and themes in the Beginner Box differ from the Jumpstart packs that can be found in Marvel Super Heroes Jumpstart .",
   "scene": 1,
   "section": "Description"
  },
  {
   "text": "10 Themed Jumpstart half-decks of 20 cards and a theme insert 2 of these are tutorial decks and are designed to be played against each other.",
   "scene": 2,
   "section": "Contents"
  },
  {
   "text": "2 \"How to Play\" guides",
   "scene": 2,
   "section": "Contents"
  },
  {
   "text": "2 Spindown life counters",
   "scene": 2,
   "section": "Contents"
  },
  {
   "text": "1 Reference guide booklet",
   "scene": 2,
   "section": "Contents"
  },
  {
   "text": "In total, the Beginner Box features 45 new cards , 26 tutorial cards , and more than sixty reprints ( 12 with new art ).",
   "scene": 2,
   "section": "Contents"
  },
  {
   "text": "There are 10 different themes.",
   "scene": 3,
   "section": "Themes"
  },
